# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.radharc.LayoutProvider version 10
call register(layout: Handle)
```

# DESCRIPTION

A layout's registration (`/svc/windows/layout`, for a client with
`grant windows layout`).

Protocol `todhchai.radharc.LayoutProvider`, version 10, of library `RadharcIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
| `register` | call | 1 | `0x4f310a479b0d5e64` |

: `register`
  Gives Radharc a channel on which the layout serves `Layout`. One
  registered under a name already held replaces it.

